    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "🤖 Telegram AI Assistant — n8n Automation\n\nProject Description\n\nBuilt an AI-powered Telegram assistant using n8n, integrating a Telegram Bot with an AI Agent, conversational memory, and an AI language model to automatically process and respond to user messages.\n\nThe workflow receives incoming Telegram messages through a Telegram Trigger, evaluates the message through conditional logic, and routes valid messages to an AI Agent. The agent uses an AI model to generate contextual responses and incorporates conversation memory to maintain continuity across interactions. The generated response is then automatically sent back to the user through Telegram.",
        "height": 352,
        "width": 704,
        "color": "#2B2B2B"
      },
